# makepkg writes its artifacts next to the PKGBUILD, and
# scripts/safe-commit-push.sh runs `git add -A` — so an untracked 25 MB tarball
# or bare clone would land in an auto-commit.
#
# Whitelist rather than blocklist: makepkg names its bare git clone after the
# source (here "noctalia-shell/"), so artifact names vary and a blocklist
# silently misses them.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*/PKGBUILD
!*/*.install
